# Homework build products. Every PDF here is regenerated by tools/build_tex.sh
# from the .tex sources, which ARE tracked. Assignment PDFs from the instructor
# are the exception -- see the negation at the bottom.

*.pdf
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.synctex.gz
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.bbl
*.blg

# Rendered figures. pgfplots draws the stem plots at build time from
# coordinates in the .tex, so nothing here needs to be stored.
*.png
*.jpg
*.svg

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# --- Deliberately NOT ignored -------------------------------------------
# The instructor's assignment PDFs are the source material, not a build
# product, and cannot be regenerated. Keep them.
!dsphw*.pdf
!hw*/dsphw*.pdf
